*   *“Is my sleep apnea currently well-managed (e.g., CPAP usage)? If not, how might that be affecting my heart rhythm and blood pressure?”*
*   *“Considering my history of retinopathy and its connection to vascular health, do I need a referral for an updated comprehensive eye exam?”*

