### 1. Hypertension & Blood Pressure Management
* "My last recorded blood pressure had a typo ('1.2'). Can we check my current blood pressure today and confirm what my ideal target range should be at age 60?"
* "Given my history of atrial fibrillation and sleep apnea, is my current dose of metoprolol (25mg) still the optimal choice for managing both my heart rate and blood pressure?"
* "Should I be monitoring my blood pressure at home? If so, how often, and when should I contact you about the readings?"

### 2. Atrial Fibrillation (AFib) & Medications
* "I am currently taking apixaban 5mg twice daily and metoprolol 25mg. Are these still the most effective options for stroke prevention and rate control for my AFib?"
* "Do we need to run any updated blood work (like kidney function, which can affect apixaban) or do an EKG today to monitor my AFib?"

### 3. Sleep Apnea Connections
* "How is my sleep apnea impacting my atrial fibrillation and blood pressure? Are there any adjustments we should make to my sleep apnea treatment (like CPAP settings) to better protect my heart?"

### 4. Retinopathy
* "Given my history of retinopathy, does my current blood pressure control adequately protect my vision?"
* "Do I need a referral for an updated comprehensive eye exam with an ophthalmologist this year?"

